gration tests (which use `rsc_render_header`) would fail.\",\"accepted_if\":\"The DSCLA-4 unit test generates its run-status comment fixture using `rsc_render_header` (the same code that writes it in production), so a format divergence between the writer and the reader is caught at the unit level, not only in integration.\",\"introduced\":true,\"fix\":\"test\"}]","files":{"/home/runner/.zbuild/repos/ezigus/zBuild/issues/1764/worktree/core/claim/claim.sh":"707f8ea05518fe3845c2d8ef7b8912a5c2f36ccd","/home/runner/.zbuild/repos/ezigus/zBuild/issues/1764/worktree/core/pipeline/runner.sh":"640b4c0571bfe697f236a515f95be55b18d805f9","/home/runner/.zbuild/repos/ezigus/zBuild/issues/1764/worktree/tests/integration/teardown-repeat-signal-test.sh":"56412590fd176648fd2d3fb0fdeaf9acd1165c23","/home/runner/.zbuild/repos/ezigus/zBuild/issues/1764/worktree/scripts/lib/run-status-render.sh":"e66946ae97fcf967c5f77ee2ea2518de3b7fda3b","/home/runner/.zbuild/repos/ezigus/zBuild/issues/1764/worktree/plugins/claim-coordinator/github-labels/plugin.sh":"70e7aca83387ee35ec149c1cdf06100c46f089f8","/home/runner/.zbuild/repos/ezigus/zBuild/issues/1764/worktree/plugins/claim-coordinator/github-labels/tests/claim-coordinator-unit-test.sh":"fcfe016bb086517ecb46b0a27f44360b8f5eb5f5","/home/runner/.zbuild/repos/ezigus/zBuild/issues/1764/worktree/core/plugin-registry/registry.sh":"3a46f76258dd2ab5d9b9288827f822cecffc56fc","/home/runner/.zbuild/repos/ezigus/zBuild/issues/1764/worktree/core/plugin-registry/lifecycle.sh":"c8332c60cf55775cf63ad0ecb99492b095eb5855","/home/runner/.zbuild/repos/ezigus/zBuild/issues/1764/worktree/core":"tree:65e4a48c66a9284bb91ee1fd0fd7d6c041ea2fd9","/home/runner/.zbuild/repos/ezigus/zBuild/issues/1764/worktree/core/state/layout.sh":"f9c4a60e8688ccd2532244acf772ac3de391cfda","/home/runner/.zbuild/repos/ezigus/zBuild/issues/1764/worktree/tests/lib/test-helpers.sh":"08bff8be3d510695e80d7efbfa619e4a6f2f9821","/home/runner/.zbuild/repos/ezigus/zBuild/issues/1764/worktree/plugins/